{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01BwDsE4asJLnjJ6EWgHN9qc", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.chinanews.com.cn/cul/2021/04-02/9445955.shtml\"}, {\"url\": \"https://m.bjnews.com.cn/detail/173526159619473.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.gia.edu/cn/gia-news-research-filigree-master-bai-china\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.gia.edu/cn/articles/gia-news-research-filigree-master-bai-china\"}, {\"url\": \"https://news.ycwb.com/ikimvkitjc/content_53970316.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://weibo.substack.com/p/042525-on-the-internet-you-can-even/comments\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.news.cn/local/20250108/12dcecf34038425f96146ce65828cf29/c.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.163.com/dy/article/DIVE918F0518JH1H.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.sohu.com/a/201123526_415387\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:56:06.827Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "点翠 最后一家工场 关闭 点翠技艺失传", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01RRJkNLWoiC7xP3wF9UVQdV", "content": [{"title": "www.chinanews.com.cn", "url": "https://www.chinanews.com.cn/cul/2021/04-02/9445955.shtml"}, {"title": "m.bjnews.com.cn", "url": "https://m.bjnews.com.cn/detail/173526159619473.html"}, {"title": "gia news research filigree master bai china", "url": "https://www.gia.edu/cn/gia-news-research-filigree-master-bai-china"}, {"title": "gia news research filigree master bai china", "url": "https://www.gia.edu/cn/articles/gia-news-research-filigree-master-bai-china"}, {"title": "content 53970316", "url": "https://news.ycwb.com/ikimvkitjc/content_53970316.htm"}, {"title": "weibo.substack.com", "url": "https://weibo.substack.com/p/042525-on-the-internet-you-can-even/comments"}, {"title": "www.news.cn", "url": "https://www.news.cn/local/20250108/12dcecf34038425f96146ce65828cf29/c.html"}, {"title": "网易首页 > 网易号 > 正文 申请入驻", "url": "https://www.163.com/dy/article/DIVE918F0518JH1H.html"}, {"title": "故宫博物院藏点翠文物:结珠铺翠 点羽成仙", "url": "https://www.sohu.com/a/201123526_415387"}]}, "搜索结果中只有一处提到具体时间：网易号的一篇文章称,1933年,国内最后一家点翠工场由于翠羽的绝世,轰然倒闭。 该文还说点翠在清末民初逐渐被烧蓝工艺取代。这是唯一明确给出关闭年份的来源,而该文是自媒体文章,没有注明原始史料,所以这一年份还需要其他权威资料进一步核实。\n\n其他结果主要涉及点翠的现状和争议:\n\n- **工艺本身**：点翠是一种金银首饰工艺,先用金或鎏金的金属做成不同图案的底座,再把翠鸟背部靓丽的蓝色羽毛镶嵌在座上。\n- **替代材料**：现在通常用替代品来仿制。目前,我国已有成熟的仿点翠工艺,用染色鹅毛、蓝色缎面丝带、养殖孔雀羽毛都能达到很好的效果。\n- **传承现状**：北京的肖氏点翠传承人肖玉妹仍在从事这一工艺,并表示一个完整的点翠,主要分为“熟翠、定翠、选翠、铡翠、裱翠、点翠、阴干”7个步骤。这说明传统技艺并未完全失传,至少在北京仍有传承人在做。\n- **争议**：由于翠鸟数量减少和制作过程的残忍性,清末民初点翠便逐渐由烧蓝(亦称点蓝)工艺取代。\n\n结论：搜索结果能支持\"点翠工场在20世纪上半叶(据称1933年)减少乃至关闭,传统真翠工艺衰落\"这一大致判断,但\"最后一家工场关闭于1933年\"这一具体说法仅来自一个来源,建议查阅更可靠的文献（如故宫或非遗相关研究）再作确认。"], "durationSeconds": 8.274764083000003, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01BwDsE4asJLnjJ6EWgHN9qc", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXSBikb2Guy3qXWBpAD", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案:1933 年。** 这个说法只有一个来源,可信度偏低。\n\n网易号的一篇文章说,1933 年国内最后一家点翠工场因为翠羽断绝而倒闭。这是自媒体文章,没有注明史料出处。我没有找到故宫、非遗或学术资料来印证。\n\n另外,北京的肖氏点翠传承人至今仍在做这门手艺,所以 1933 年之说只能理解为传统真翠工场的衰落,不能当作技艺彻底断绝。\n\n我一共搜了 2 次。\n\nSources:\n- [网易号:点翠相关文章](https://www.163.com/dy/article/DIVE918F0518JH1H.html)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1575, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5426, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1575}, "output_tokens": 241, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:56:11.037Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXSBSt1ZBrNAuwUbBcZ"}
